The crysknife comes from Frank Herbert's _Dune_ books, where they are made from
the teeth of the sandworms by the desert-dwelling Fremen.  In the books, they
lost their edge if they were away from the owner's "body electrical field" (?)
for more than a couple hours.  Older versions of hack had this effect too -
crysknife's became worthless if you unweilded them for long.  However, I don't
know if this is true in nethack too.

